"""
The cloud-profile Hermit driver domain as a package derivation
(docs/spectrum_plan.md §8, Sprint 8 task 8.2).

Data-only recipe, the sibling of LinuxDriverKernel: it pins the domain
shape of `../hermit-rs/k8s/httpd.yml` (1 core, 64 MiB, virtio-only) and
the build facts read firsthand from the `../hermit-rs/` checkout:

  * `sources` is empty for the same recorded reason as LinuxDriverKernel
    (PLAN_avm_pkg §4.8 supplier note): there is no unikernel image payload
    in this workspace to hash, and the `kernel/` git submodule
    (hermit-os/kernel) is not checked out;
  * `builder_symbol` is `hermit.build` with an explicit `BUILDER_STATUS`
    env row: no unikernel-building builder exists here (kernel submodule
    absent, machine offline). The evaluation path honest-refuses on an
    unknown builder rather than pretending — the capable-host steps live in
    docs/spectrum_plan.md §8 (Sprint 8 task 8.4).

Exported through `austral compile … --pkg-totality=true
--emit-derivations=plan.json` and hashed by `avm-pkg drv-hash`, same
release contract as the seed package set (PLAN_avm_pkg §4.8).
"""
import Derivation (
    Derivation
);

module HermitDomain is
    constant hermit_domain: Derivation;
end module.
